    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relic Abyss is an action-filled anomaly that mixes lovecraftian fantasy with medieval sci-fi, bundled in a cute art-style and a banger soundtrack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017760/extras/5758bd14db1f02ea4693a52764239c27.poster.avif?t=1755512412\" width=650 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017760/extras/5758bd14db1f02ea4693a52764239c27.webm?t=1755512412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017760/extras/5758bd14db1f02ea4693a52764239c27.mp4?t=1755512412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a desolate yet beautiful world being consumed by the Abyss. Embark on a quest to preserve existence, meeting fellow adventurers along the way! Discover ancient relics, forge powerful gear, and evolve your skills to defeat primal evil and prevent catastrophe!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2640\ufe0f<strong>Play up to 20 uniquely designed adventurers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017760/extras/c5405a4ac35bb9098c9f277fc184a353.avif?t=1755512412\" width=650 height=366 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udd25<strong>Over 134+ Unique Character Skills including Ultimate Skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017760/extras/1995e1e733a6df6e607b2311bf3a32f8.poster.avif?t=1755512412\" width=650 height=364 ><sour